{"pages":[{"w":612.0,"h":792.0,"s":[[13.889,2.549,18.126,3.431,3.431,"EQUINOX"],[13.889,5.414,15.104,1.078,1.078,"Q U A N T I T A T I V E"],[69.444,2.954,13.975,1.471,1.471,"US Equity Research"],[69.444,4.401,11.116,1.307,1.307,"18 November 2026"],[13.889,11.323,17.797,3.268,3.268,"CoreWeave"],[13.889,14.944,35.187,2.124,2.124,"Can the backlog pay for the buildout?"],[13.889,21.007,52.941,1.634,1.634,"CoreWeave’s third-quarter revenue rose 168% to $3.66bn as active power"],[13.889,22.453,52.941,1.634,1.634,"passed 1.7 GW. CoreWeave can recognize revenue from its $132.5bn backlog as"],[13.889,23.898,52.941,1.634,1.634,"it delivers computing capacity. Two customers supplied 54% of quarterly sales."],[13.889,25.344,52.942,1.634,1.634,"Operating income reached $207m, but net interest expense of $846m pushed the"],[13.889,26.79,52.942,1.634,1.634,"quarter to a $709m net loss. Through September, cash from operations covered"],[13.889,28.235,52.941,1.634,1.634,"$5.64bn of $23.56bn in cash purchases of property and equipment. The shares"],[13.889,29.681,24.915,1.634,1.634,"closed at $49.89, down 30% this year."],[13.889,32.168,52.942,1.634,1.634,"1) We forecast $4.84bn of Q4 revenue, up 32% sequentially, to reach the"],[13.889,33.614,52.942,1.634,1.634,"$13.15bn midpoint of FY26 guidance. The adjusted operating profit midpoint"],[13.889,35.06,52.941,1.634,1.634,"requires a 16.5% Q4 margin, up from 10.4% in Q3. 2) Our FY27 sales of"],[13.889,36.506,52.941,1.634,1.634,"$25.5bn assume quarterly revenue rises from $5.25bn to $7.50bn as new sites"],[13.889,37.951,52.942,1.634,1.634,"begin billing. 3) We hold FY27 capital spending at $38bn. Management expects"],[13.889,39.397,52.941,1.634,1.634,"$9bn in customer deposits and prepayments over three months, reducing its"],[13.889,40.843,52.942,1.634,1.634,"near-term borrowing needs. 4) We model $4.8bn of FY27 net interest against"],[13.889,42.288,38.619,1.634,1.634,"$3.2bn of operating income, leaving a $2.93 loss per share."],[13.889,44.776,52.941,1.634,1.634,"Our Dec-27 target of $59 averages two methods. Holding today’s 2.8x forward"],[13.889,46.221,52.941,1.634,1.634,"sales multiple on $35.5bn of FY28 revenue gives $57 per share. A DCF gives"],[13.889,47.667,52.941,1.634,1.634,"$61 at an 11% cost of capital and 3.5% terminal growth. Both deduct $66bn of"],[13.889,49.113,52.941,1.634,1.634,"Dec-27 net debt and assume 590m shares. Each additional $5bn of net debt costs"],[13.889,50.559,52.942,1.634,1.634,"$8.47 per share if enterprise value holds. The target offers 18% upside, above"],[13.889,52.004,52.942,1.634,1.634,"our 15% Overweight threshold. Faster site openings or cheaper debt lift equity"],[13.889,53.45,52.942,1.634,1.634,"value. Power delays or a customer deferral would leave interest accruing ahead"],[13.889,54.896,7.35,1.634,1.634,"of revenue."],[69.444,11.484,12.458,2.288,2.288,"Overweight"],[69.444,13.941,18.448,1.307,1.307,"NASDAQ: CRWV  |  CRWV US"],[69.444,15.244,14.894,1.307,1.307,"Price (17 Nov 26): $49.89"],[69.444,16.83,17.872,1.307,1.307,"Price Target (Dec-27): $59.00"],[69.461,20.88,10.704,1.471,1.471,"US Technology"],[69.444,22.723,7.565,1.389,1.389,"Yash Sarda"],[69.444,24.138,20.152,1.144,1.144,"Analyst, Equinox Quantitative Research"],[69.444,25.223,11.442,1.144,1.144,"AI Cloud Infrastructure"],[69.461,28.38,10.296,1.471,1.471,"Company Data"],[69.444,29.709,14.39,1.307,1.307,"Shares outstanding, A+B (mn)"],[92.415,29.709,2.682,1.307,1.307,"556.1"],[69.444,30.845,8.698,1.307,1.307,"52-week range ($)"],[88.54,30.845,6.557,1.307,1.307,"40.58–138.25"],[69.444,31.982,8.102,1.307,1.307,"Market cap ($bn)"],[92.415,31.982,2.682,1.307,1.307,"27.75"],[69.444,33.118,13.643,1.307,1.307,"Cash & securities, Sep ($bn)"],[93.012,33.118,2.086,1.307,1.307,"4.18"],[69.444,34.254,9.356,1.307,1.307,"Net debt, Sep ($bn)"],[92.415,34.254,2.682,1.307,1.307,"43.34"],[69.444,35.391,9.116,1.307,1.307,"Backlog, Sep ($bn)"],[92.415,35.391,2.682,1.307,1.307,"132.5"],[69.444,36.527,11.081,1.307